# magic-agent — Track 1 spot runtime environment template
#
# Copy to .env in the repo root before running:
#   cp .env.example .env
# NEVER commit .env (it is gitignored). Fill with real values.
#
# FORMAT: systemd EnvironmentFile= and `set -a; . .env; set +a` both consume this file.
# Keep every comment on its OWN `#` line — no inline comments after a value.
# Each setting must be a clean `KEY=value` line with NO trailing comment.
#
# Run-loop tuning (symbol, executor mode, log path) is set via `magic-agent run`
# CLI flags, NOT here. This file holds secrets, credentials, and integration config only.
#
# See docs/track1-spot-runbook.md for the full activation checklist before going live.

# ── Execution mode ──
# The executor is set via the CLI flag `--executor [paper|twak]`.
# Paper is the default and requires no credentials here.
# `--executor twak` is the only live opt-in; it requires TWAK below.

# ── TWAK (spot swap signer + x402 payments) ──
# TWAK is the SOLE signer for BSC swaps and CMC x402 payments.
# It is NEVER used for ERC-8004 identity (that path uses bnbagent-sdk separately).
# TWAK_WALLET_PATH: path to the TWAK wallet keystore file on this machine.
TWAK_WALLET_PATH=/path/to/your/twak/wallet.json
# TWAK_WALLET_PASSWORD: password protecting the keystore. KEEP SECRET.
TWAK_WALLET_PASSWORD=your-wallet-password-placeholder

# ── BSC JSON-RPC ──
# MAGIC_AGENT_BSC_RPC: BSC mainnet JSON-RPC endpoint for on-chain balance queries,
# receipt polling, nonce tracking, and gas reserve checks.
MAGIC_AGENT_BSC_RPC=https://bsc-dataseed.binance.org

# ── CMC (CoinMarketCap) ──
# MAGIC_AGENT_CMC_API_KEY: CoinMarketCap API key for rank/veto context fetches.
# When set, a real CMC client is wired in. When empty, CMC context degrades to
# "unavailable" (full passthrough — no veto, no boost). CMC NEVER creates setups.
MAGIC_AGENT_CMC_API_KEY=your-cmc-api-key-placeholder
# MAGIC_AGENT_CMC_BASE_URL: optional base-URL override for CMC API calls.
# Leave empty to use the default: https://pro-api.coinmarketcap.com
MAGIC_AGENT_CMC_BASE_URL=

# ── x402 budget ──
# X402_MAX_REQUEST_USD: maximum USD spend per single x402 CMC request (Decimal string).
MAGIC_AGENT_X402_MAX_REQUEST_USD=0.01
# X402_MAX_DAILY_USD: maximum total USD spent on x402 CMC requests per calendar day.
MAGIC_AGENT_X402_MAX_DAILY_USD=1.00

# ── ERC-8004 on-chain identity (OPTIONAL — needs `uv sync --extra identity`) ──
# Identity stays "unregistered" even with these set until the bnbagent-sdk wiring is
# validated against real docs (see runbook Known Limitation c).
# MAGIC_AGENT_ERC8004_URI: agent metadata URI. Empty = identity disabled (unregistered).
MAGIC_AGENT_ERC8004_URI=
# MAGIC_AGENT_ERC8004_RPC: EVM RPC endpoint for the ERC-8004 registration transaction.
MAGIC_AGENT_ERC8004_RPC=
# MAGIC_AGENT_ERC8004_KEY: signing key for the ERC-8004 registration tx. KEEP SECRET.
MAGIC_AGENT_ERC8004_KEY=

# ── LLM advisor (OFF by default — pure deterministic path is the safe default) ──
# MAGIC_AGENT_LLM_API_KEY: Anthropic API key. Empty = advisor disabled.
MAGIC_AGENT_LLM_API_KEY=
# MAGIC_AGENT_LLM_MODEL: model id override. Defaults to claude-sonnet-4-6 when empty.
MAGIC_AGENT_LLM_MODEL=

# ── Dashboard / API ──
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE: browser-facing base URL the Next.js dashboard calls for /api/*.
# Served by `magic-agent serve` behind a reverse proxy.
# Example: https://your-domain.example.com/api
# BUILD-TIME: inlined into the web bundle at `npm run build` — set before building
# and rebuild after any change.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=
